  "story": {
    "day": 166,
    "title": "Kaya's Rainy Day Plans",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya spent a rainy day at home.",
      "She helped Mom make pork curry.",
      "Mom asked, \"Hand me 2 ounces of thin soy sauce.\"",
      "They added tomato, corn, mushrooms, and lettuce.",
      "\"We mustn't heat it too quickly!\" Mom warned.",
      "Kaya thought, \"Such a yummy dessert! It'll be pudding.\"",
      "\"Tomorrow, we'll certainly go to the swimming pool,\" Mom decided.",
      "\"You'll go hiking, but won't climb the high hill.\"",
      "Kaya looked forward to skiing next winter; she'll be 13 years of age.",
      "She also needed to research calligraphy, a dolphin, an octopus, or a zebra.",
      "Her phone began to ring. \"They'll come for spaghetti soon!\"",
      "Kaya, feeling sleepy, hurried her foot to the restroom, hearing a small scream."
    ]
  }
